class Solution {
    public int[] twoSum(int[] nums, int target) {

        HashMap<Integer, Integer> map = new HashMap<>();
        for(int i = 0; i < nums.length; i++)    {
            int compliment = target - nums[i];
            if(map.containsKey(compliment))
                return new int[]{i, map.get(compliment)};
            
            map.put(nums[i], i);
        }
        return new int[] {0,0};
    }
}

Create a HashMap of value and idx and simultoneously check for its compliment if both found no need to trace the entire array and return the current index and compliment's index.
